1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,218
ConVision data flow
Selected stages from the vision-guided sorting concept. Hardware, protocol, and timing are
illustrative.

2
00:00:04,318 --> 00:00:11,230
Position the part
The control sequence brings a part into the camera inspection position.

3
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:18,247
Classify the image
The Jetson-side vision stage assigns a class to the inspected part.

4
00:00:18,347 --> 00:00:25,263
Transfer the class to the PLC
The class result becomes control data for the sorting sequence.

5
00:00:25,363 --> 00:00:32,149
Route the part
The PLC coordinates the conveyor and diverter to send the part to its matching bin.
